  <ferc:DisclosureOfApplicableNotesTextBlock id="f-24" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica Light',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:130%"&gt;Notes to the financial statements identified as &#8220;modified&#8221; were revised from those that were included in Cleco&#8217;s and Cleco Power&#8217;s combined Quarterly Report on Form 10-Q to exclude information relating to Cleco Holdings LLC and its other affiliated companies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:100.000%"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:98.900%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;padding:1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;GLOSSARY OF TERMS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Abbreviations or acronyms used in this filing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:100.000%"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:22.319%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:75.481%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="background-color:#ffffff;border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;padding:1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:6pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;ABBREVIATION OR ACRONYM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="border-bottom:1pt solid #000000;padding:1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:6pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;DEFINITION&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="border-top:1pt solid #000000;padding:1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;2016 Merger&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="border-top:1pt solid #000000;padding:1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"&gt;&lt;div style="padding-left:9pt;text-indent:-9pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Merger of Merger Sub with and into Cleco Corporation pursuant to the terms of the Merger Agreement, which was completed on April 13, 2016&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"&gt;&lt;div style="padding-left:9pt;text-indent:-9pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;2016 Merger Commitments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:1.5pt 1pt 1.5pt 10pt;text-align:left;text-indent:-9pt;vertical-align:top"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica Condensed',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Cleco Partners&#8217;, Cleco Group&#8217;s, Cleco Holdings&#8217;, and Cleco Power&#8217;s 77 commitments to the LPSC as defined in Docket No. U-33434&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"&gt;&lt;span style="col